0:{"buildId":"OG8eCAthKGUJyzKMGQdxl","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"title":"Theming","description":"Customize colors, fonts, and styling for the React SDK.","content":"## Theme Prop\n\nSet the theme on `AdkitProvider`:\n\n```tsx\n<AdkitProvider siteId=\"...\" theme=\"dark\">\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `\"light\"` - Light mode\n- `\"dark\"` - Dark mode  \n- `\"auto\"` - Follow system preference (default)\n\n## CSS Variables\n\nOverride CSS variables to customize colors:\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --adkit-primary: #6366f1;\n  --adkit-background: #ffffff;\n  --adkit-text: #0a0a0a;\n  --adkit-border: #e5e5e5;\n}\n\n.dark {\n  --adkit-background: #0a0a0a;\n  --adkit-text: #fafafa;\n  --adkit-border: #262626;\n}\n```\n\nContent coming soon.","slug":"react/theming"}],[["$","script","script-0",{"src":"/_next/static/chunks/10623e2afbf6a84c.js","async":true}]],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$4",null,{"name":"Next.MetadataOutlet","children":"$@5"}]}]]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
